  "aboutPrivacyDescription": "Halo creates no account, contains no ads or analytics, and sends nothing to its authors. Your calendar, screen time, data usage, Bluetooth devices, favourite contacts, steps and sleep (Health Connect) are read on the phone and never leave it. Only a few requests leave the phone: the coordinates of the chosen place, sent to Open-Meteo for weather, rain, pollen, air quality and the sea; the Network widget's ping and, when you start it, its speed test, to Cloudflare's servers. The Moon and its phases are computed on the phone. Your settings stay on the phone.",
