  "wallpaperQuantumMotionText": "The columns' rows of connectors light up from the bottom, one per tenth of battery. Control pulses run down the cables to the chip and the readout flows back up; the chip beats and its qubits twinkle. While charging, a cold wave runs down the cable loops.",
