  "wallpaperNeuralDescription": "Circuit's phone, detailed down to the vias, with an AI accelerator in place of the battery: its package, four memory stacks and, on the die, a brain etched in traces.",
  "wallpaperNeuralMotion": "The inference",
  "wallpaperNeuralMotionText": "In a loop, the memories are read layer by layer, the data races to the brain, a wave spreads from its midline to the pads, then the answer flows back up the ribbons and the processor's cores light up. The lit pads follow the battery. While charging, the coils glow, the midline pulses and inferences speed up.",
  "themeNeuralDescription": "A silicon brain on its board, electric blue.",
  "themeSoundNeuralRing": "Inference",
  "themeSoundNeuralRingText": "A run of quick notes, like a thought taking shape",
  "themeSoundNeuralNotification": "Token",
